 {r}←C HandleServerLicenses targetPath;ns;version;caption;NOTICE;report;from;to
⍝ Establishes the version numbers for Rumba and Plodder, adds them to NOTICE, then adds
⍝ the licenses of the JavaScript libraries served from "Assets/" and finally the licenses
⍝ for all packages the server depends on.
 r←0
 ns←⎕NS''
 '#.Plodder.Version'ns.⎕CY'Assets/Runtime/Plodder/Plodder.dws'
 version←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'+'}2⊃ns.Version
 caption←'## Plodder ',version
 NOTICE←('# Third-Party Licenses' ''caption'```'),(⊃⎕NGET'Assets/Runtime/Plodder/LICENSE' 1),'```' ''
 '#.RumbaLean.Version'ns.⎕CY'Assets/Runtime/Plodder/Plodder.dws'
 version←{⍵↑⍨¯1+⍵⍳'+'}2⊃ns.Version
 caption←'## Rumba ',version
 NOTICE,←(caption'```'),(⊃⎕NGET'Assets/Runtime/Rumba/LICENSE' 1),'```' ''
⍝ Unlike Plodder and Rumba these three have no version that could be interrogated: they are
⍝ served as one combined download. When the bundle in "Assets/" is replaced by a newer one
⍝ the version numbers must be updated here as well.
 caption←'## jQuery 3.6.0'
 NOTICE,←(caption'```'),(⊃⎕NGET'Assets/JS/LICENSE-jQuery' 1),'```' ''
 caption←'## DataTables 1.12.1'
 NOTICE,←(caption'```'),(⊃⎕NGET'Assets/JS/LICENSE-DataTables' 1),'```' ''
 caption←'## Responsive 2.3.0'
 NOTICE,←(caption'```'),(⊃⎕NGET'Assets/JS/LICENSE-Responsive' 1),'```' ''
 from←C.HOME,'/packages'
 to←targetPath,'/Server/'
 report←NOTICE ##.Registry.CreateNoticeFile from to
 ('Not all dependencies have a LICENSE file:',(⎕UCS 13),¨report)Assert 0=≢report
⍝Done
